{"5028220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Clipmatrix", "steam_appid": 5028220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the underground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clipmatrix</strong> turns off-limits terrain into a high-speed playground. <br>Master Source-inspired momentum and carve out your own routes through the underground speed scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028220/extras/e42b0698b8a4bba259c36a95bb932f0a.poster.avif?t=1787011186\" width=1170 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028220/extras/e42b0698b8a4bba259c36a95bb932f0a.webm?t=1787011186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028220/extras/e42b0698b8a4bba259c36a95bb932f0a.mp4?t=1787011186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>150+ Tracks to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice through a <strong>100 level campaign</strong>, then enter the <strong>Random Matrix</strong>—an endless race that adds 50 extra tracks into an unpredictable, non-linear loop. Hit the spots in any order, find your line, and post your best times on global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028220/extras/990581b5fd71540624332ede8824ea0e.poster.avif?t=1787011186\" width=1170 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028220/extras/990581b5fd71540624332ede8824ea0e.webm?t=1787011186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028220/extras/990581b5fd71540624332ede8824ea0e.mp4?t=1787011186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seamless Multiplayer </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not the only one out there hopping fences. Hang out in the <strong>Hub</strong> with hundreds of players and jump into live lobbies supporting up to <strong>250 concurrent runners</strong> all hitting the same track at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028220/extras/da2d397be5a8fe608f129cd4f917ea76.poster.avif?t=1787011186\" width=1170 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028220/extras/da2d397be5a8fe608f129cd4f917ea76.webm?t=1787011186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028220/extras/da2d397be5a8fe608f129cd4f917ea76.mp4?t=1787011186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Style, With Zero Real Cash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect, equip, and inspect <strong>rare knives and custom cosmetics</strong>. Build your dream loadout—<strong>100% free</strong>, earned entirely through gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028220/extras/c44bf486cce4465d69b3307be4c23035.poster.avif?t=1787011186\" width=1170 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028220/extras/c44bf486cce4465d69b3307be4c23035.webm?t=1787011186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028220/extras/c44bf486cce4465d69b3307be4c23035.mp4?t=1787011186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>150+  Tracks:</strong> Master <strong>100 campaign levels</strong> plus the <strong>Random Matrix</strong>—a 150-track shuffling pool for non-linear, unpredictable runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards</strong>: Race your own ghost, your friends, or the best in the world with Steam Leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Bhop Physics</strong>: Built on tight, momentum-driven air-strafing and speed preservation inspired by classic Source movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game-Breaking  Gear:</strong> Use tools, like a <strong>pipebomb</strong> or a <strong>grapple hook</strong> to change the game entirely and shatter records.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>250-Player Underground Hub:</strong> Hang out, and hit tracks live alongside up to <strong>250 concurrent players</strong> in seamless lobbies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dedicated Tutorial:</strong> Learn strafe timing, momentum preservation, and speed mechanics from scratch in a clear, step-by-step training mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purely Earned Cosmetics:</strong> Collect, equip, and inspect rare knives and custom gear—<strong>100% free</strong> through gameplay.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the underground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clipmatrix</strong> turns off-limits terrain into a high-speed playground. <br>Master Source-inspired momentum and carve out your own routes through the underground speed scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i