strafing and speed preservation inspired by classic Source movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game-Breaking  Gear:</strong> Use tools, like a <strong>pipebomb</strong> or a <strong>grapple hook</strong> to change the game entirely and shatter records.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>250-Player Underground Hub:</strong> Hang out, and hit tracks live alongside up to <strong>250 concurrent players</strong> in seamless lobbies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dedicated Tutorial:</strong> Learn strafe timing, momentum preservation, and speed mechanics from scratch in a clear, step-by-step training mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purely Earned Cosmetics:</strong> Collect, equip, and inspect rare knives and custom gear—<strong>100% free</strong> through gameplay.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Clipmatrix is a momentum platformer built on classic bhop physics. Slip past the fences of surreal industrial facilities to film illicit, high-speed runs. Just don't forget to press record.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028220/9edb5084ff7772521fa28955488cf255b670dd3d/header.jpg?t=1787011186", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028220/2ae03f47cc9a8557e3133e4b5482b9a960cd1c66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787011186", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028220/2ae03f47cc9a8557e3133e4b5482b9a960cd1c66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787011186", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Dreamware Media"], "publi